<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n60505" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῠβ-εύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>play at dice</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Cratin.
				195
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ec.</u>
				672
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				15.287
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<i>run a risk</i> or <i>hazard</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περὶ διπλασίων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>HG</u>
					6.3.16
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Art.</u>
				17
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περὶ τοῖς φιλτάτοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Prt.</u>
					314a
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. τῷ βίῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					6
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> trans.,
				<i>run the risk of, venture on</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κυβεύων τὸν πρὸς Ἀργείους Ἄρη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					446
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be staked,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				7.427.13
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Antip.Sid.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c.acc.pers.,
				<i>cheat, defraud</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>Epict.</u>
				2.19.28
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				3.21.22
			</span></i>.</div>
